{
  "schemaVersion": "seo-site-photo-text-check-v1",
  "note": "The words the text check of a photo before it is made leaves out (check-photo-text.mjs, lib/photo-class.mjs; owner 2026-11-17, via Site Factory: a photo's subject is checked against its page's H1 and copy by code, no model, and one that does not match is not made and is reported). A photo's subject shares at least PHOTO_TEXT_MIN_SHARED of its own words with its page's H1 and copy (a section's brief, with the page's H1 and its section's heading and text); these words say how a photo is taken or name what any photo can show, so they never count as shared. Words are read lower case, plural s dropped, three letters or more.",
